  "decision_conditions": [
    "Prior to the first occupation of the development hereby permitted  details of  15 accessible, secure and covered off-highway cycle parking spaces to be provided at this site shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The facilities as approved shall then be provided at the site prior to the first occupation of the flats hereby permitted  and retained at the site thereafter in accordance with the approved drawings at all times.\n\nReason: In order to ensure that satisfactory provision is made to accommodate vehicles and cycles within the site, and to accord with Policy T5 of the London Plan and Policy LP23 of the Council’s Local Plan."
